1
00:00:47,104 --> 00:00:52,240
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:53,700
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:55,856
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:58,880
=Episode 8=

5
00:01:00,679 --> 00:01:01,359
He said

6
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:04,040
I wasn't worthy to be one of his own.

7
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,560
And you actually said

8
00:01:09,879 --> 00:01:11,000
I was one of Mian's own?

9
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:18,480
Mian and I

10
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:20,519
only met once.

11
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:22,120
He had his face covered.

12
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:24,760
But I'll never forget

13
00:01:25,719 --> 00:01:27,159
what happened that day.

14
00:01:30,359 --> 00:01:31,079
You're not him.

15
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:33,640
So you still have to take

16
00:01:38,599 --> 00:01:39,640
the Hundred-Cut Punishment.

17
00:01:42,959 --> 00:01:43,519
Zhou Yan.

18
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,079
You've been in Huaguo all this time.

19
00:01:47,079 --> 00:01:48,519
First time in Langia, right?

20
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:51,760
Playing along with you was fun,

21
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:54,920
but I'm tired of it.

22
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:57,480
Show's over.

23
00:01:57,879 --> 00:01:59,000
Save his heart for me.

24
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,560
Mian damaged mine.

25
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:02,079
His will make up for it.

26
00:02:02,079 --> 00:02:02,599
Nobody move!

27
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:07,959
You're just a hostess.

28
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,439
One night with him

29
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,560
and you forget who your boss is?

30
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:12,400
Come on.

31
00:02:12,919 --> 00:02:13,560
Shoot me right here.

32
00:02:13,919 --> 00:02:14,520
Do it!

33
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,199
If you pull that trigger,

34
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,479
I swear

35
00:02:17,479 --> 00:02:18,840
you'll both be carried out.

36
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,759
Try me.

37
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,080
Kill me,

38
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:22,319
and see if you make it out alive.

39
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,439
Whether I live or die,

40
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,919
I'll kill you both first.

41
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,360
Hand over your gun.

42
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,520
Unless you want a hole in your head.

43
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:38,520
That's right.

44
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:40,759
He's definitely not Mian.

45
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:52,759
But...

46
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:55,560
he's Mian now.

47
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,080
Sorry.

48
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:01,639
I'm late.

49
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,719
You're right on time.

50
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:22,240
You brought me here to meet Mian?

51
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,680
(Zhou Yan.)

52
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,000
(When did you figure it out?)

53
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,360
When I heard Suka died in that crash,

54
00:03:36,159 --> 00:03:37,439
I knew you had made your move.

55
00:03:38,919 --> 00:03:41,080
(I like dealing with smart people.)

56
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:43,280
(While I was away from Langia,)

57
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:45,479
(Natuo, Suowen, and Dashan)

58
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:47,240
(built their own power bases.)

59
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:49,080
(They don't answer to me anymore.)

60
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:51,360
(I need you to take them out.)

61
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,240
Why would I help you?

62
00:03:53,719 --> 00:03:55,599
(You're already using my identity.)

63
00:03:55,599 --> 00:03:57,759
(Now get your revenge in my name)

64
00:03:57,759 --> 00:04:00,080
(and finish the job I gave you.)

65
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,000
(Otherwise,)

66
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,280
(I'll take my name back.)

67
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:05,560
(Then you'll rot in prison.)

68
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,599
(Everything)

69
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:08,639
(is up to you.)

70
00:04:10,759 --> 00:04:11,919
Mian's been missing for years.

71
00:04:13,159 --> 00:04:14,919
Someone's bound to check
if I'm really Mian.

72
00:04:15,879 --> 00:04:17,240
I need to know your past.

73
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:19,519
As detailed as possible.

74
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:27,480
Are you kidding me?

75
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:29,360
Since when does

76
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,480
a piggy with a lousy cane

77
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:32,439
get to call himself Mian?

78
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:34,839
I don't buy it.

79
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:35,639
Natuo.

80
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:37,759
You dare question Mian?

81
00:04:38,879 --> 00:04:40,319
Didn't Songcai teach you the rules?

82
00:04:41,079 --> 00:04:41,879
Songcai?

83
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,000
If you've got the guts,

84
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,959
leave my dad out of this.

85
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:46,439
Natuo.

86
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:48,839
Calm down.

87
00:05:00,639 --> 00:05:02,560
I liked you better when you were cocky.

88
00:05:04,959 --> 00:05:05,399
Suowen.

89
00:05:06,959 --> 00:05:08,199
Still want my heart?

90
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:10,839
Sorry.

91
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:11,959
Mian.

92
00:05:13,079 --> 00:05:13,920
No. I wouldn't dare.

93
00:05:16,439 --> 00:05:16,680
Hey.

94
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:17,800
You, trafficker.

95
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,319
Didn't you say I didn't deserve a drink?

96
00:05:22,079 --> 00:05:22,439
Come here.

97
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:23,959
Drink it.

98
00:05:35,639 --> 00:05:36,120
Drink it.

99
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,279
You ungrateful brat!

100
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,560
Dad?

101
00:05:58,560 --> 00:05:59,560
What are you doing here?

102
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,600
Get on your knees before Mian now!

103
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,160
Apologize!

104
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:17,639
Mian.

105
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:18,839
I was wrong.

106
00:06:19,199 --> 00:06:19,800
Please forgive me.

107
00:06:23,439 --> 00:06:24,079
Starting today,

108
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,120
I'll settle every score between us

109
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,439
one by one.

110
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,199
I told you.

111
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:38,839
This ends with one of us dead!

112
00:07:26,079 --> 00:07:27,000
This is too sweet.

113
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:30,000
Your blood sugar's low.

114
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:30,839
You need something sweet.

115
00:07:31,519 --> 00:07:33,160
Do you think Mian
would ever sit out here like me,

116
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:34,759
with milk tea and dessert?

117
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:35,920
Doesn't that ruin the image?

118
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,680
You're still worried about that?

119
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:40,800
You just became Mian,

120
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,160
and you're already making threats.

121
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,000
Aren't you forcing them to come at you?

122
00:07:44,399 --> 00:07:45,360
I'll have to fight them sooner or later.

123
00:07:46,079 --> 00:07:47,040
All I have is Mian's name.

124
00:07:47,959 --> 00:07:49,399
Dashan, Suowen, and Natuo

125
00:07:49,399 --> 00:07:51,360
control half of Langia.

126
00:07:52,079 --> 00:07:52,920
That's why I made that threat.

127
00:07:53,439 --> 00:07:55,040
It'll stop other factions
from backing them,

128
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:55,920
leaving them isolated.

129
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,439
Then I'll have a shot at taking down
Langia's Three Scourges.

130
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,279
You've changed.

131
00:08:04,399 --> 00:08:07,120
You're nothing like when you got here.

132
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,560
To survive in Langia,

133
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,000
you have to shed your old skin.

134
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,759
Have you met the real Mian?

135
00:08:18,879 --> 00:08:19,560
You seem...

136
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,360
awfully interested in Mian.

137
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:24,839
I...

138
00:08:25,959 --> 00:08:26,839
You're a nurse,

139
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,680
but you carry a gun.

140
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,320
Don't you think it's time
you told me who you really are?

141
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:35,559
I...

142
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:42,159
Does my identity really matter?

143
00:08:42,759 --> 00:08:44,559
What matters is our shared goal.

144
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,679
Dashan, Suowen, and Natuo.

145
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,480
Langia's Big Three.

146
00:08:49,159 --> 00:08:50,320
I want to take them down too.

147
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,559
We can work together.

148
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:53,240
Okay. I trust you.

149
00:08:55,679 --> 00:08:56,840
Meet me tomorrow at 2 p.m.

150
00:08:57,559 --> 00:08:59,159
But someone should be coming
to see me now.

151
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:00,720
At this hour?

152
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:01,679
Who?

153
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,519
Mr. Mian.

154
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,960
Ms. Layla would like to see you.

155
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,399
See? Told you.

156
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,759
Ms. Layla is very sharp.

157
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,720
She would come see Mian right away.

158
00:09:15,879 --> 00:09:16,080
Hey.

159
00:09:16,879 --> 00:09:17,399
Your clothes.

160
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:19,039
Oh.

161
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:41,039
The famous Mr. Mian.

162
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,080
I never expected this.

163
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:44,840
Neither did I.

164
00:09:46,279 --> 00:09:47,840
You're beautiful, Ms. Layla,

165
00:09:48,519 --> 00:09:49,720
and you speak our language so well.

166
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:52,879
In my line of work,
I deal with people from Huaguo a lot.

167
00:09:53,679 --> 00:09:55,159
Of course I had to learn the language.

168
00:09:56,519 --> 00:09:57,240
Speaking of business,

169
00:09:58,200 --> 00:10:00,559
back home,
we'd call you a real shark, Ms. Layla.

170
00:10:01,279 --> 00:10:02,440
After I was taken to the station,

171
00:10:03,279 --> 00:10:05,360
you didn't say a word in my defense.

172
00:10:07,679 --> 00:10:09,639
What happened that day was an accident.

173
00:10:10,679 --> 00:10:12,080
I meant to call the police

174
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:13,919
and have Natuo arrested.

175
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:15,519
I didn't expect

176
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,440
you to get caught up in it, Mr. Mian.

177
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,039
So...

178
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,559
how are you going to punish me?

179
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,480
Don't pull that act with me.

180
00:10:36,519 --> 00:10:36,879
Just tell me.

181
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,679
What did you call me here for?

182
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:40,919
For business.

183
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,840
I'm in the jade trade,

184
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,559
and you know jade inside and out.

185
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,399
Of course I want you on my side.

186
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:53,440
That day,

187
00:10:53,879 --> 00:10:56,080
I did try to use you
to get dirt on Natuo,

188
00:10:56,879 --> 00:10:58,639
but he denied everything.

189
00:11:00,879 --> 00:11:01,759
As for what would happen to you,

190
00:11:02,799 --> 00:11:04,320
it wasn't my concern at the time.

191
00:11:07,279 --> 00:11:09,000
Now that you know I'm Mian,
you want me on your side.

192
00:11:10,679 --> 00:11:11,960
If you'd helped me back then,

193
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,399
Sihan wouldn't have died so tragically.

194
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,600
I don't care about
anyone else's life or death,

195
00:11:18,879 --> 00:11:19,519
I only care about you,

196
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,399
a Mian who hates Natuo.

197
00:12:00,336 --> 00:12:01,560
♪Dust rises along the border♪

198
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:03,072
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

199
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,368
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

200
00:12:04,384 --> 00:12:05,680
♪Friends yesterday, now in battle♪

201
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:06,896
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

202
00:12:07,020 --> 00:12:08,208
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

203
00:12:08,210 --> 00:12:09,584
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

204
00:12:09,610 --> 00:12:11,232
♪My life is mine to bear♪

205
00:12:11,550 --> 00:12:14,048
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

206
00:12:14,300 --> 00:12:16,816
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

207
00:12:16,980 --> 00:12:18,980
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

208
00:12:19,020 --> 00:12:20,752
♪My fate is mine to command♪

209
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:21,552
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

210
00:12:21,584 --> 00:12:22,910
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

211
00:12:22,910 --> 00:12:24,224
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

212
00:12:24,226 --> 00:12:25,600
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

213
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:27,040
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

214
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:28,272
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

215
00:12:28,273 --> 00:12:29,392
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

216
00:12:29,395 --> 00:12:31,088
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

217
00:12:31,090 --> 00:12:32,144
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

218
00:12:32,147 --> 00:12:33,728
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

219
00:12:33,740 --> 00:12:34,816
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

220
00:12:34,818 --> 00:12:36,320
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

221
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:38,880
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

222
00:12:42,100 --> 00:12:43,072
♪With blood and sweat♪

223
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:44,480
♪I forge my glory♪

224
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,468
♪In this world of chaos♪

225
00:12:45,470 --> 00:12:47,129
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

226
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:48,176
♪My legend♪

227
00:12:48,176 --> 00:12:50,170
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

228
00:12:54,704 --> 00:12:57,120
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

229
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:59,120
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

230
00:13:00,020 --> 00:13:02,020
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

231
00:13:02,030 --> 00:13:03,344
♪My fate is mine to command♪

232
00:13:03,472 --> 00:13:05,050
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

233
00:13:12,670 --> 00:13:14,032
♪My fate is mine to command♪

234
00:13:14,272 --> 00:13:15,060
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪
